anistream's Android player builds on mpv-android
================================================

The player's JNI shim (libanistream_mpv.so, src/main/cpp/anistream_mpv.c, grown out of the spike's
in android/Spikes/Player) and its surface handling (MpvClient.attach, resize and detach) are
adapted from mpv-android's app/src/main/jni and BaseMPVView.kt:

