What anistream changed: one state per mpv handle, so a second mpv can make seek previews; JSON read
into mpv's nodes for the commands and properties that take one; mpv's warnings handed to the
player as well as to logcat.

libmpv and FFmpeg's libraries, which android/scripts/mpv.sh builds as LGPL, carry their own
licences. The APK ships them, with this file and android/mpv/NOTICE, under assets/licences/player.
